  "description": "<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"585\">This charming <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"390\">pet house made of water-hyacinth</strong> is a natural, breathable, and cozy space for your furry companions. Handwoven by skilled Vietnamese artisans, it combines functionality, comfort, and sustainable design in one beautiful product.</p>\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"891\">Ideal for small pets like cats and small dogs, the house features a rounded, enclosed shape that provides privacy and warmth. The sturdy natural fiber ensures durability, while the smooth texture is gentle on your pet&#8217;s skin. It’s a stylish addition to homes, pet shops, hotels, and eco-conscious brands.</p>\n<p data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1038\">At <strong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"927\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong>, we offer <strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"963\">OEM/ODM customization</strong>, eco-friendly packaging, and <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1018\">bulk wholesale supply</strong> to global partners.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1043\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1067\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1067\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1402\">\n<li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1109\">\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1109\">Made from 100% natural water-hyacinth</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1153\">\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1153\">Breathable, biodegradable, and pet-safe</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1206\">\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1206\">Handwoven with strong frame and smooth finishing</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1239\">\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1239\">Lightweight and easy to move</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1296\">\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1296\">Custom sizes, shapes, colors, and branding available</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1353\">\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1353\">Ideal for indoor pet use – cats, small dogs, rabbits</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1402\">\n<p data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1402\">Sustainable and ethically crafted in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1407\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1436\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1434\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1476\">Choosing this handmade pet house helps:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1772\">\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1531\">\n<p data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1531\"><strong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1529\">Support rural artisans and farmers in Vietnam</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1599\">\n<p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1599\"><strong data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1567\">Utilize excess water-hyacinth</strong>, reducing environmental waste</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1656\">\n<p data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1656\"><strong data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1638\">Generate foreign currency income</strong> through exports</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1725\">\n<p data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1725\"><strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1701\">Create jobs during non-harvest seasons</strong> for local communities</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1772\">\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1772\"><strong data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1772\">Preserve Vietnamese handcraft traditions</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1914\">As a reliable <strong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1837\">manufacturer, factory, and wholesale exporter</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1870\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong> is committed to quality and sustainability.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1919\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1955\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1953\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2047\">📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1989\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"1992\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2047\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2234\">",
